WEBVTT

00:04:28.723 --> 00:04:31.267
Because you've got to learn to count.

00:04:31.309 --> 00:04:34.186
And the only number
that matters is five --

00:04:34.228 --> 00:04:35.396
(Laughter)

00:04:35.438 --> 00:04:39.150
which is a majority
of the justices on the Court.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:42.278
Now, when Casey went
to the High Court in 1992,

00:04:42.278 --> 00:04:46.198
I was convinced that there were
five justices then

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.034
prepared to overrule Roe

00:04:48.617 --> 00:04:52.663
and return to the states
the ability to ban abortion.

00:04:54.206 --> 00:04:55.791
I was correct.

00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:57.168
Right after my argument,

00:04:57.168 --> 00:05:00.129
the justices returned
to their conference room and took a vote,